{"sourceUrl":"https://rwskxb.hit.edu.cn/2026/0622/c20438a394636/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:54.133927+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rwskxb.hit.edu.cn/2026/0622/c20438a394636/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>为促进优秀大学生之间的学术交流，加强全国学生对哈工大人文社科学部的了解，人文社科学部将于</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span>中旬</span><span>举办研究生学术交流营活动</span><span>，</span><span>欢迎全国各地的同学参加！</span></p><p><span>一、报名资格</span></p><p><span><span>全日制</span><span>2027</span><span>届本科毕业生，有望在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生资格；</span></span></p><p><span>二、申请流程</span></p><p><span><span>1. </span><span>申请形式：</span></span></p><p><span><span>登陆学术交流营报名表单，链接如下：</span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/rFwo5YF.aspx# </span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><span>报名截止时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span><span>报名申请需上传如下材料</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）个人简历、学生证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章成绩排名证明原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）体现英语水平的证明材料（专业四八级考试</span><span>/</span><span>大学英语四六级考试</span><span>/</span><span>托福</span><span>/</span><span>雅思成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）其他证明材料，包括：已发表的代表性论文</span><span>1</span><span>篇，应提供全文，其他已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页扫描件；本科期间各类获奖证书扫描件。</span></span></p><p><span>注：以上材料原件在入营时审核。</span></p><p><span><span>请申请人将以上材料扫描后合成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，文件命名为“本科院校</span><span>-</span><span>学生姓名</span><span>-</span><span>报名学科</span><span>/</span><span>专业”上传至报名链接，如上传不成功，请以邮件主题为“学术交流营</span><span>+</span><span>学生姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科学校</span><span>+</span><span>申请学科”的形式，发送至指定邮箱</span></span><span>hit_rwsk@163.com</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>4. </span><span>确定名单：学部重点考察申请者学业水平、科研能力和综合素质，确定入营者名单。入营者名单将于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日前分批通过邮件方式通知。届时未入选者，不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span>三、活动安排</span></p><p><span><span>1. </span><span>报到时间：预计</span><span>7</span><span>月中旬</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><span>报到地点：哈尔滨工业大学一校区外语楼</span><span>101</span><span>室</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span><span>活动内容：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）开营式，学校和学院基本情况介绍；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）学术交流：专家学术报告，学科专业介绍，座谈交流；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）校园参观：参观博物馆、航天馆等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）闭营式。</span></span></p><p><span>四、其他说明</span></p><p><span><span>1. </span><span>学部将为营员提供学术交流营期间在哈尔滨的食宿。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><span>营员报到后要求全程参加学术交流营的活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span><span>具体日程会根据实际情况进行调整。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. </span><span>具体政策以学校当年的文件为准。</span></span></p><p><span>五、联系方式</span></p><p><span>联系人：丁老师</span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0451-86414509</span></span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：</span></p><p><span><span>外国语言文学</span><span>/</span><span>翻译：</span></span><span>hit_rwsk@163.com</span></p><p><span><span>社会学</span><span>/</span><span>社会工作：</span><span>Liujh@hit.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>应用经济学：</span><span>13936241018@qq.com</span></span></p><p>哈尔滨工业大学人文社科学部</p><p>2026年6月22日</p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"0afea9917fa978d21c654a8b1601a17337d6e512770b6ff9106f4abc3c9b497d","textLength":962,"sourceSha256":"46ef43f313fa3958945404af8a7b0f3acb995d707d0a0510e84b9a225bd7c539","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-abfa7d7570bb06f401a5","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学人文社科学部2026年学术交流营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:54.133927+00:00"}
